==Acquisition==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|Cape and Player Card set]] can be bought from the [[Dust Devils Premium Warbond|Dust Devils]] page on the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|SC|120|notext}} and 40 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

